=== Lande factors of trivalent rare-earth ions (Hund's rules) ===
ion  S  L  J  g_J  lambda_S=g_J-1  lambda_S/(g_J/2)
Ce3+  1/2  3  5/2  6/7 (0.8571)  -1/7 (-0.1429)  -0.333
Sm3+  5/2  5  5/2  2/7 (0.2857)  -5/7 (-0.7143)  -5.000
Gd3+  7/2  0  7/2  2 (2.0000)  1 (1.0000)  1.000
Dy3+  5/2  5  15/2  4/3 (1.3333)  1/3 (0.3333)  0.500
Ho3+  2  6  8  5/4 (1.2500)  1/4 (0.2500)  0.400
Er3+  3/2  6  15/2  6/5 (1.2000)  1/5 (0.2000)  0.333
check projection identity: lambda_S = <S.J>/J(J+1) = [J(J+1)+S(S+1)-L(L+1)]/[2J(J+1)] = g_J - 1 (same expression)

