=== MnF2 ===
omega_E = 5.447 meV, omega_A = 0.0949 meV, omega_A/omega_E = 0.0174
omega_AFMR = sqrt(omega_A(2omega_E+omega_A)) = 1.021 meV = 247 GHz [measured gap 1.1 meV at 4 K, 1302.4867]
